WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.985
(mellow music)

00:00:06.505 --> 00:00:08.363
- If you're gonna start drag,

00:00:08.363 --> 00:00:12.705
the place you start is with yourself.

00:00:12.705 --> 00:00:13.842
Who are you?

00:00:13.842 --> 00:00:15.246
What's your objective with this?

00:00:15.246 --> 00:00:16.569
Why do you wanna do this?

00:00:16.569 --> 00:00:18.334
Drag doesn't change who you are.

00:00:18.334 --> 00:00:20.048
It actually reveals who you are.

00:00:20.048 --> 00:00:22.137
(mellow music)

00:00:22.137 --> 00:00:25.667
Your kindness, I like a kind drag queen,

00:00:25.667 --> 00:00:27.408
'cause first of all, you gotta understand,

00:00:27.408 --> 00:00:29.382
people who gravitate toward drag

00:00:29.382 --> 00:00:32.888
are sweet, sensitive
souls, who have uncovered

00:00:32.888 --> 00:00:37.183
the mystery of our society,
which is, it's all a hoax.

00:00:37.183 --> 00:00:38.756
Our society is a matrix.

00:00:38.756 --> 00:00:40.281
It's all an illusion.

00:00:40.281 --> 00:00:41.790
Don't become bitter.

00:00:41.790 --> 00:00:44.971
That's the biggest challenge you'll have

00:00:44.971 --> 00:00:46.573
when you get into drag.

00:00:46.573 --> 00:00:48.825
(mellow music)

00:00:48.825 --> 00:00:52.924
I don't care if you are in
the backseat of a tricked car,

00:00:52.924 --> 00:00:54.270
or if you were in church,

00:00:54.270 --> 00:00:55.619
or if you were on stage,

00:00:55.619 --> 00:00:58.034
do not take your shoes off,
do not take your wig off.

00:00:58.034 --> 00:01:00.704
That is my number one pet peeve,

00:01:00.704 --> 00:01:02.933
and that is the rule for life.

00:01:02.933 --> 00:01:04.117
Know that.

00:01:04.117 --> 00:01:05.859
Let the church say amen.

00:01:05.859 --> 00:01:08.389
(mellow music)

00:01:08.389 --> 00:01:10.595
Don't spend so much time

00:01:10.595 --> 00:01:12.313
trying to get people to like you.

00:01:12.313 --> 00:01:13.800
It's really a waste of time.

00:01:13.800 --> 00:01:14.821
If you're a kind person,

00:01:14.821 --> 00:01:17.715
if your intension is kindness and love,

00:01:17.715 --> 00:01:19.015
you have nothing to worry about.

00:01:19.015 --> 00:01:20.640
And you let your tribe find you.

00:01:20.640 --> 00:01:22.638
You find your tribe, you
let your tribe find you,

00:01:22.638 --> 00:01:23.822
but you can't force it.

00:01:23.822 --> 00:01:26.724
(mellow music)

00:01:26.724 --> 00:01:28.790
The best piece of advice
I've ever been given

00:01:28.790 --> 00:01:32.598
was given to me by my
tenth grade drama teacher.

00:01:32.598 --> 00:01:34.270
I think I was gonna get expelled,

00:01:34.270 --> 00:01:37.823
or something was up, but
I was really distraught.

00:01:37.823 --> 00:01:42.231
And he said to me, "RuPaul," my real name,

00:01:42.231 --> 00:01:45.266
"don't take life too
(censored) seriously."

00:01:45.266 --> 00:01:48.122
Now of course then, I didn't
know what he was talking about,

00:01:48.122 --> 00:01:52.418
didn't understand it,
but here 40 years later,

00:01:52.418 --> 00:01:55.338
you better believe I know
what he's talking about.

00:01:55.338 --> 00:02:00.321
(mellow music)

